B.bn5=new A.bJ(B.fO,["Who we are",'The Customs Brokers Association of Ghana ("CUBAG", "we") runs this app for its members and applicants. We handle your personal data in line with the Data Protection Act, 2012 (Act 843). This policy explains what we collect, why, and the choices you have.'],t.o)
B.bn4=new A.bJ(B.fO,["What we collect","\u2022 Who you are: your name, email address, phone number and company.\n\u2022 Your professional details: licence and membership numbers, company classification and the district you work in.\n\u2022 Documents you upload: for example tax clearance certificates, brokerage permits and identity documents.\n\u2022 Payments: the amount, purpose, reference and receipt of each payment, and the Mobile Money number or bank details you pay from."],t.o)
B.bmX=new A.bJ(B.fO,["How we use it","Only to run your membership:\n\u2022 to review your application and your compliance documents;\n\u2022 to issue your membership card, verification code and licence;\n\u2022 to record and confirm your dues and course payments;\n\u2022 to send you notices about your documents, payments and the association.\nWe do not sell your information."],t.o)
B.bmV=new A.bJ(B.fO,["Who can see it","Authorised staff of the CUBAG Secretariat. Payment providers receive only what they need to process a payment. Your name, company and membership status may appear in the member directory and when someone scans your verification code."],t.o)
B.bmW=new A.bJ(B.fO,["Keeping it safe","Your data travels over encrypted connections, and access is limited to Secretariat staff who need it."],t.o)
B.bmY=new A.bJ(B.fO,["Your rights","You can ask to see the information we hold about you, to correct it, or to delete your account. Use Settings in the app, or email the Secretariat."],t.o)
